{"Title":"An Act to ensure fairness in retirement benefits for certain employees of the Department of Correction","BillNumber":"H2618","DocketNumber":"HD1025","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JJO1","Name":"James J. O'Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JJO1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T01:10:03.61"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JJO1","Name":"James J. O'Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JJO1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T01:10:03.61"},{"Id":"DMD1","Name":"Daniel M. Donahue","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DMD1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-02T12:51:32.9633333"},{"Id":"WCG1","Name":"William C. Galvin","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WCG1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-08T12:29:37.75"},{"Id":"AJS1","Name":"Adam J. Scanlon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJS1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-08T12:29:37.75"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2618/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative O'Day of West Boylston, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2618) of James J. O'Day and Daniel M. Donahue relative to retirement benefits for certain employees of the Department of Correction.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 3 of chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting, in line 325, after the words “assistant deputy superintendent” the following words:- correctional program officer A/B, C, D, or equivalent or successive titles who have been employed in such capacities or other Group 4 titles for 10 years or more\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAm